WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.269 --> 00:00:05.080
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright is not allowed

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:10.550
to classify any researcher, including himself,
as a memetic hazard!

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:12.940
Memetic hazards are not to be taken lightly.

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:17.630
Many of the SCP Foundation's best and brightest
have been cut down in their prime by memetic

00:00:17.630 --> 00:00:21.980
hazards that ate away at their sanity and
destroyed their minds.

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:26.910
Just because Dr. Bright likes singing "The
Song that Never Ends" and annoying everyone,

00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:31.090
that does not make him a memetic hazard by
Foundation standards.

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:36.040
Other behaviors that do not qualify a researcher
as a memetic hazard include but are not limited

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:41.750
to: whistling all the time, clipping their
nails at their desk, or microwaving fish in

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:42.530
the break room.

